+    "| `segment` | thriveline segment id |\n",
+    "| `start_age`, `start_z` | anchor covariate and z-score |\n",
+    "| `response_var` | brain region |\n",
+    "| `offset` | point index along the segment (0 = anchor) |\n",
+    "| `X`, `Z`, `Y` | covariate, z-score, and response value |\n"
