+   "id": "dffb76aa",
+   "metadata": {},
+   "source": [
+    "## 1. Load precomputed correlation matrix\n",
+    "\n",
+    "`load()` loads only one specific file layout: the velocity models from Johanna\n",
+    "Bayer's pipeline, saved in `batch_<n>_<region>/Velocity/<file>.pkl`. The region name is not stored inside the file, so it is read from the directory name."
+   ]
+  },
+  {
+   "cell_type": "code",
+   "execution_count": 8,
+   "id": "e51bce7b",
+   "metadata": {
